				Node:       n,
				Category:   "logic",
				Failure:    "this block is empty, you can remove it",
			})
			return nil // skip visiting the range subtree (it will produce a duplicated failure)
		}
	case *ast.BlockStmt:
		if !w.ignore[n] && len(n.List) == 0 {
			w.onFailure(lint.Failure{
				Confidence: 1,
				Node:       n,
				Category:   "logic",
				Failure:    "this block is empty, you can remove it",
